  "description": "The 40\" plug aerator is made of black powder coated steel and the plug aerator is towed by a garden tractor. It has a convenient weight tray that allows you to add weight as needed for optimum performance.\nIts 24 galvanized and ground plug coring knife hollow teeth will penetrate your grass area up to 2 inches and have a working width of 101 cm (40 inches). The best time to use the aerator is when turf moisture content is high. Using the towed plug aerator will allow air, moisture and nutrients to enter the grass root system while reducing soil compaction. Six steel spike discs provide soil aeration up to 2 inches deep, creating reservoirs that bring oxygen, fertilizer and water into the root zone.\nThe aerator is equipped with 10-inch pneumatic tires for easy transport, and a cantilevered handle allows you to quickly adjust work and transport.\nFitment\nAttaches easily to every lawn tractor and most ZTRs and ATVs And the dual tow bar is more durable and tougher to use.\nFeatures\n40\" Working Width:40\" Tow Plug Lawn Aerator will help you grow the beautiful lawn that you've always wanted.\nEfficiency upgrade:24 Galvanized and sharpened plug coring knives.\nPowerful Function: 6 steel spike disks provide soil aeration penetration of up to 2\" in depth to create reservoirs that bring oxygen, fertilizer, and water into the root zone.\nUniversal Hitch:Easily attaches to every lawn tractor and most ztrs and ATVs. And double tow-behind bars are more durable and rigid for use.\nNote: Pay attention to avoid injury during assembly and use.",
